// The clock of the JVM a program runs on.
//
// `docs/specs/io.md` states what it gives back. It is one `extern` declaration away from a JVM
// method, which `docs/specs/interop.md` states.
// Only the difference of two readings in one run has a meaning, because the start point has none.
extern static nanoseconds() -> Int = "java.lang.System.nanoTime"
